Number of changes: 1

1. Modified | Implementation code block
   Replaced the original index conversion and `_pyexpr.list_take` call with directly returning `self.gather(indices)`.
   The original implementation included:

   * Conditional statement: when `index` was a `list`, convert it to `pl.Series(index)`;
   * Assignment statement: pass `index` to `parse_as_expression(index)` and reassign the result;
   * Return statement: return `wrap_expr(self._pyexpr.list_take(index, null_on_oob))`.

   The new implementation includes:

   * Return statement: return `self.gather(indices)`.
